# xed
===
 xed is a small and lightweight text editor. xed supports most standard editing features, plus several not found in your typical text editor including plugins. The plugins allow a variety of tasks related to text editing.
 
 **Key Features**
 - Complete support for UTF-8 text
 - Syntax highlighting
 - Support for editing remote files
 - Search and Replace
 - Printing and Print Previewing Support
 - File Revert
 - A complete preferences interface
 - Configurable Plugin system, with optional python support
 
